  "output_network_interpretation": [
    "R1=0R joins VDDA decoupling; SD capacitors are connected through U10 when enabled. Treat full-network sum as a conservative stability screening scenario, not proof of exact loop impedance.",
    "Board-only capacitors exclude capacitance inside the chosen microSD and other connected devices.",
    "15% added positive capacitance is a sensitivity corner; DC-bias reduction, temperature correlation, aging and ESR have not been characterized. Crossing22uF does not prove actual instability; it prevents qualification from nominal capacitance alone.",
    "Do not blindly increase C4 or C27 to improve transient response. Check actual effective total against regulator stability range and load-step performance."
  ],
